  "releaseNotes": "- Added two convenience factory methods to RSEndpointExecutionOptions to simplify common Web API scenarios.\n\t\t  - WithTokenSID() now preconfigures the options with UseHeaderContext + InjectResponseHeaders and automatically loads TokenSID via GetTokenSID().\n\t\t  - WithTokenSIDAndNoneMatch() now preconfigures the options with TokenSID + ClientIfNoneMatch (via GetClientIfNoneMatch()), enables HandleNotModified304, and keeps header injection enabled for proper ETag/304 behavior.",
